  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Our African Women Skills Training Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Africa drop out of education early and the two main reasons is to take up running the home or due to lack of sanitary wear. Either way the number of unskilled women across Africa is alarming and we need to help women take control and get back into work. This project allows women to train for free and get skills that will result in them getting local employment or setting up their own micro-business to sell to the tourist trade. Who doesn&apos;t love an Africa bag?</narrative>
  </description>
